Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:35.600
Micchi's Heart Thumping Hot Spring Tour

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:37.220
Good morning.

00:01:37.550 --> 00:01:39.300
Let's go to a hot spring.

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:40.510
Wh-at?

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:43.730
Come on, let's go to a hot spring, okay?

00:01:43.730 --> 00:01:45.140
Ehm…

00:01:45.140 --> 00:01:48.560
I'm sorry, I don't quite get what you're saying.

00:01:48.900 --> 00:01:54.740
I was just talking to Nishikiyori-kun about living in Japan.

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:57.780
Nishikiyori-kun says he's never been to a hot spring.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:00.030
I wonder which hot spring will be the best.

00:02:00.030 --> 00:02:03.490
Well, in this season…

00:02:03.870 --> 00:02:05.710
When shall we go?

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:08.290
It sounds like fun, one big bath.

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:12.380
Like I said, I haven't decided on coming yet.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:17.470
Not only is it good for encouragement, but we can get to know each other better while naked!

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.510
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:22.850
Let's take this chance to get to know each other better.

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:24.720
Right, Kazune-kun?

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.100
I suppose you're right.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:33.020
Kazune-kun?

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:37.200
It seems we can talk about a lot of things in a hot spring.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:43.330
I got it! What about we go during our next vacation?

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:46.790
Eh? The next vacation won't do.

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.370
Right, Yuki?

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:49.870
Right.

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:51.330
I see.

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:55.260
For Kazune-kun to accept his proposal…

00:02:56.760 --> 00:03:00.840
Could it be that he's become mesmerized because of that kiss the other day?

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:02.760
What's wrong?

00:03:24.620 --> 00:03:27.250
So this is the Nakayoshi hot spring.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:30.870
Anyways, why did you come along?

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.420
You're hot spring glasses guy.

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:34.500
I'm not a "hot spring glasses guy".

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:36.500
I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.670
I asked him to come along.

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:43.600
Because, it seemed that you weren't getting along.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:47.560
I thought you could use this opportunity to make up.

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:50.980
This has turned into a complex situation.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:55.730
This boy called Nishikiyori troubles me.

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:58.570
This is a rare chance.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:01.400
This time I'll get them for sure.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:12.250
It sure has been a long time since our last hot spring, hasn't it?

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:13.500
Yeah.

00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:15.880
Good day, Karin-chan.

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:19.050
So, you were here too, Kirika-senpai?

00:04:20.550 --> 00:04:21.590
Please take good care of me.

00:04:21.590 --> 00:04:24.930
The same goes for me, please take good care of me.

00:04:25.350 --> 00:04:27.850
To be at a hot spring with Kirika-senpai…

00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:30.180
Ha-ha! I'm so happy I came along.

00:04:30.180 --> 00:04:32.630
It sure is fun, isn't it, Hanazono-san?

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:35.150
Stop this, not in front of senpai!

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:37.270
Don't be so embarrassed, Hanazono-san.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.070
I'm not embarrassed!

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:40.440
Let me go!

00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:44.530
What the hell is Nishikiyori thinking?

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:07.550
That's some amazing cooking, isn't it?

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:09.100
Looks delicious.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:14.100
Ah, I made such a terrible mistake!

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:15.060
What's wrong?

00:05:15.400 --> 00:05:19.440
I have prepared enough food to feed all but one of you.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:20.730
What should I do?

00:05:21.030 --> 00:05:23.440
Well then, why don't you just order some more?

00:05:23.440 --> 00:05:28.410
Either Kazune-kun or Kirio-kun won't have anything to eat like this!

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:30.200
Wait a minute.

00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:33.160
Why does it have to be Karasuma's or my share?

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:35.750
Wasn't taking care of everything your job?

00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.210
Thank goodness.

00:05:37.210 --> 00:05:39.880
I thought I wouldn't have anything to eat.

00:05:40.250 --> 00:05:43.720
I just thought of some splendid entertainment.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.510
That is: Kazune-kun and Kirio-kun,…

00:05:46.510 --> 00:05:49.850
You will both have to compete one another and the winner gets the food.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:50.350
How about it?

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:52.810
Stupid.

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.480
I won't do it.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:56.520
That's right.

00:05:56.520 --> 00:05:57.730
It's alright.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.770
I'll share my portion with you.

00:06:01.610 --> 00:06:03.690
So are you afraid of losing?

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:09.160
Don't say such stupid things! There is no way I can lose against him.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:11.030
That's what I should say.

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.250
First up is round one.

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:21.710
Imitation

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:26.880
Well then, I'll sing "Munekyun Idol" with an imitation of Kuga Jin.

00:06:27.090 --> 00:06:31.450
Your hip style, and interesting voice

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:35.230
You make me nervous, my Sugar Face.

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:36.730
Get ready.

00:06:37.140 --> 00:06:40.900
Okay everybody, how was this performance?

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:42.230
8 points.

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:43.070
5 points.

00:06:43.070 --> 00:06:43.980
1 points.

00:06:43.980 --> 00:06:45.190
100 points.

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:50.410
How naive, Kujyou.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:51.570
What?

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:55.950
Watch and be amazed, at my amazing mimicry!

00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:00.120
Living in Tanzania, I will be imitating the African Mantis.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:03.420
It seems like Kazune-kun has fainted!

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:04.670
1 points.

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:05.590
3 points.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:06.970
-100 points.

00:07:06.970 --> 00:07:08.970
1000 points!

00:07:10.190 --> 00:07:12.010
Hidden talent.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.180
Here I come!

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.980
Give it your best shot, Karasuma!

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:23.570
Here I go, Kujyou!

00:07:23.900 --> 00:07:25.440
Give it your best shot, Karasuma!

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:26.940
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:28.320
Look that way.

00:07:28.320 --> 00:07:29.700
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:07:29.700 --> 00:07:30.990
Look that way.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.870
Foot Massaging

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:43.000
Ah, I can't take this anymore.

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:46.000
Himeka-chan, let's take a bath.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:48.800
Yes, let's.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.690
Female

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.610
Wow, it's huge!

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:24.960
I couldn't really see, but she sure was pretty.

00:08:24.960 --> 00:08:29.340
Karin-chan, look!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:34.390
It says they have a outdoor bath!

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:36.720
Let's try it out.

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:40.270
It says it's mixed!

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:43.190
MIXED

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:43.190
Ah, so it does.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:46.520
Mixed means that there'll be boys too, right?

00:08:46.520 --> 00:08:48.820
That's too embarrassing!

00:08:49.030 --> 00:08:51.320
I'll be fine over here.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:54.910
I wouldn't know what I'd do if I met Kirika-senpai there.

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.620
I see.

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:02.500
But, isn't it great?

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:06.500
That Kirika-senpai came as well.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:11.840
Yes! Kazune-kun doesn't trust him, but there's no way such a great senpai could be our enemy.

00:09:13.420 --> 00:09:17.600
Anyways, Kazune-kun is quite something.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:20.560
To get all fussed up over glasses guy.

00:09:20.560 --> 00:09:22.770
That's what you call childish.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:26.770
That imitation didn't sound at all right!

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:30.230
Yeah.

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:34.700
But, didn't you give him 100 points?

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:40.160
That was, well, uhm…

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.960
The person you like…

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:53.550
Is it Kazune-kun?

00:09:56.260 --> 00:09:59.010
Well, uhm…

00:09:59.010 --> 00:10:02.020
Right? I thought so.

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:09.190
I love Kazune-chan.

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:14.320
But… that might be because we've been together since we were children.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:20.660
So he's like a brother to me.

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:25.910
And sometimes, he's even like a father to me.

00:10:26.870 --> 00:10:33.300
I love him, but not as a lover.

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:42.310
I feel like I'm alive when I'm around Kazune-kun.

00:10:42.890 --> 00:10:45.640
It's really special.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:57.610
That's why I don't really want him to do dangerous things like fight for my sake.

00:10:58.450 --> 00:11:08.040
If anything were to happen to you or Kazune-chan, I'd just cry.

00:11:11.830 --> 00:11:13.210
Himeka-chan.

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:18.800
It'll be alright! I won't worry you.

00:11:18.800 --> 00:11:20.130
I promise.

00:11:22.470 --> 00:11:25.350
"I feel like I'm alive…"

00:11:25.350 --> 00:11:30.690
That's amazing. The "I love you" feelings I have for Kirika-senpai,…

00:11:30.690 --> 00:11:32.520
are probably no match for that.

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:36.610
I wonder what Kazune-kun thinks…

00:11:39.780 --> 00:11:41.660
…about Himeka-chan.

00:11:42.160 --> 00:11:43.950
Ha-na-zo-no-san!

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:50.120
What are you doing here, Micchi?!

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:54.040
I was thinking of taking a bath with you.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:56.050
This is women only!

00:11:56.630 --> 00:11:59.090
You don't need to be so stubborn.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:00.720
We need to do some naked bonding-

00:12:00.720 --> 00:12:02.680
Dosukoi!

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:07.350
Huh, was that Nishikiyori-kun?

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:10.350
It's okay now, I kicked him out.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:19.860
I'm going to go bath first.

00:12:19.860 --> 00:12:20.650
Okay.

00:12:21.150 --> 00:12:26.280
I can't believe you got so worked up over your contests with Kujyou-kun.

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.870
But, I'm happy.

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:35.840
You're still at ease, even though Mom died.

00:12:36.340 --> 00:12:39.630
Being with Kujyou-kun and Karin-chan is fun, too.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:41.220
I'm sure, if we talked-

00:12:41.220 --> 00:12:42.930
If we're going to do it, it best be soon.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:45.720
Nii-san.

00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:50.390
They're probably off guard now.

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.110
Ah darn, I fell asleep.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:11.410
Are you looking for this?

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.210
When did you…

00:13:15.630 --> 00:13:21.130
Nishikiyori, I don't know what you're thinking, nor what you know…

00:13:21.670 --> 00:13:24.090
but don't say anything unnecessary to Karin.

00:13:24.720 --> 00:13:26.390
Unnecessary?

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:31.520
Ah, you mean that you're the "child of god transformation".

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:42.770
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:13:43.850 --> 00:13:46.310
I am God!

00:13:50.020 --> 00:13:51.270
You moron.

00:13:50.250 --> 00:13:51.270
It's a croquette!

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:59.840
Kazune-kun, do you know what "give and take" means?

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:07.260
I don't mind not telling Hanazono-san about this…

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:11.720
but in exchange, what are you going to give me?

00:14:17.480 --> 00:14:20.270
That was a nice bath, right?

00:14:20.270 --> 00:14:23.150
Yeah, hot springs sure are nice.

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:25.650
So this is where you were, amateur goddess.

00:14:26.610 --> 00:14:28.240
Ah, just-bathed glasses guy.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:30.490
I'm not a "just-bathed glasses guy",…

00:14:30.490 --> 00:14:31.830
I'm Karasuma Kirio!

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:34.790
And anyway, I haven't taken a bath yet!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.290
Even though it feels so good…

00:14:37.290 --> 00:14:39.290
I know it feels good!

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:43.550
I'll take my time enjoying a bath after I defeat you!

00:14:44.710 --> 00:14:46.260
Karin-chan.

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:49.550
It's okay, I'll protect you no matter what.

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:54.350
I am God!

00:14:56.480 --> 00:14:57.060
What?

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:03.780
What the heck is this?!

00:15:06.150 --> 00:15:08.740
What did you do?

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:12.160
There's a lot I want to know about.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.790
About the rings, for example.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:15.790
Karin.

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:16.750
A transformation?

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.160
Dammit, I let my guard down.

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:20.120
Ego sumo deus!

00:15:28.470 --> 00:15:32.050
W-W-What the heck is this?!

00:15:33.390 --> 00:15:37.480
Awesome. Even though your rings are switched you can still transform!

00:15:37.930 --> 00:15:39.940
The rings are switched… ?

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.810
I wanted to test that out.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:45.650
If you could transform even if you had the wrong ring.

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.030
Don't screw around!

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.870
You bastard, do you understand what you've done?

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:57.950
It's nothing to get so upset about, it was just a joke!

00:15:57.950 --> 00:16:00.250
You don't understand this at all!

00:16:00.250 --> 00:16:03.920
Do you have any idea how dangerous is it to fight using a ring other than you're own?

00:16:04.210 --> 00:16:09.130
Is it so important that you have the power of a certain god?

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:10.260
What?

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:12.510
I suppose that's right.

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:15.140
You're a human that has been created like a god.

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:21.770
There's no reason for you to be in this world except for using godly powers.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.690
You can say whatever you want, but…

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:30.240
if anything has happened to Karin,…

00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:31.650
I will show no mercy.

00:16:38.490 --> 00:16:42.790
I don't know what to do with this transformation!

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:45.210
And besides, where is Shii-chan?

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:50.630
This is heaven~

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:53.260
Hey you, what is this?

00:16:53.260 --> 00:16:55.550
I don't know either!

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:57.680
Karin! Are you okay?

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:58.890
Kazune-kun.

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:00.770
Kazune-chan.

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:05.560
K-Kazune-kun, I didn't know you swung that way.

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:08.150
The rings were switched.

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:09.320
The rings have?

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:10.860
I'll explain it into detail later.

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:12.200
Okay.

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:16.570
I don't know what's going on, but switching god powers is a stupid thing to do.

00:17:17.200 --> 00:17:18.580
But, I will show no mercy!

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:23.080
Battle Transformation, using Hades' Power!

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.130
This is a great opportunity to crush both of you.

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:31.670
What's with that expression?

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:36.590
W-What the hell is this?!

00:17:36.930 --> 00:17:38.260
Crossdressing glasses guy.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:40.430
I'm not a "crossdressing glasses guy"!

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:41.770
I'm Karasuma Kirio.

00:17:42.850 --> 00:17:45.140
Has my ring been switched?

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:49.440
I'll do it like this!

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.150
Terebro Nox!

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:55.700
Kazune-kun!

00:17:55.700 --> 00:17:59.490
I'm fine. It seems he can't use his full power either.

00:17:59.780 --> 00:18:01.830
But I can still handle you two!

00:18:04.710 --> 00:18:05.580
Kazune-kun!

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:31.400
Who is that?

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:33.230
What a sad expression.

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:36.570
Is this…

00:18:36.740 --> 00:18:37.490
Karin.

00:18:37.990 --> 00:18:38.570
Karin!

00:18:39.780 --> 00:18:41.490
Karin, are you okay?

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:42.950
Yes.

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:48.630
Even if it's not originally my power, but how long will you last?

00:18:48.920 --> 00:18:51.790
Karin, I'm going to borrow your powers for a bit.

00:18:52.550 --> 00:18:54.300
God Thunder!

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:56.090
What?

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:04.100
If only the rings hadn't been switched… I would have killed you.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.520
Kazune-kun!

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:09.060
Kazune-chan!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:10.810
Kazune-kun!

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:33.130
Thank goodness.

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:36.510
As I thought, there's nobody here in the early morning.

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:44.640
A lot sure happened during this trip.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:49.060
I was surprised to find that I could still transform even when the rings were swapped.

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:52.560
Did someone come in?

00:19:53.650 --> 00:19:54.980
Kazune-kun!

00:19:55.360 --> 00:19:56.320
Tears…

00:19:57.110 --> 00:19:57.900
Karin!

00:19:58.780 --> 00:20:00.950
Why are you here this early in the morning?

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:03.740
Because I thought there wouldn't be anyone else at this time.

00:20:09.210 --> 00:20:12.380
Was Kazune-kun crying?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:14.340
It couldn't be.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:15.630
I'm sorry.

00:20:16.340 --> 00:20:21.010
Because I didn't pay attention, I didn't notice the rings had been swapped.

00:20:21.010 --> 00:20:23.600
I should be the one apologizing.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:26.310
You had to save me yesterday…

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:31.270
I still don't really understand the godly powers.

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:34.860
God, huh?

00:20:37.030 --> 00:20:40.610
I don't believe that no matter what.

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:45.410
I might have been able to use this power since I was a child.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:48.450
But I don't feel like a god.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.580
And even if I was…

00:20:56.170 --> 00:20:59.920
It doesn't matter if I'm a god or a human.

00:21:01.090 --> 00:21:05.890
We get hurt, from the time we're born.

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:08.560
Even with the ability to transform…

00:21:11.270 --> 00:21:14.060
I'm sorry, for speaking about weird things.

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:15.900
It's okay.

00:21:19.570 --> 00:21:23.660
But if I can't transform anymore…

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:25.200
nothing will be left of me.

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:28.700
That's not true!

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:31.040
Why are you saying such stupid things?

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:34.620
There is a girl who really thinks you're special!

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.420
Even I…

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:42.010
You always say such things to cheer me up.

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:44.510
Thank you.

00:21:54.190 --> 00:21:55.230
What is this?

00:21:55.900 --> 00:21:59.150
It's not as if I did anything bad…

00:21:59.150 --> 00:22:03.360
but I somehow feel weird inside my heart.

00:22:03.700 --> 00:22:05.910
Ha-na-zo-no-san!

00:22:08.950 --> 00:22:09.990
Micchi!

00:22:09.990 --> 00:22:11.660
Ni-Nishikiyori!

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:13.250
Since when did you…

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:14.960
I've been here for awhile…

00:22:15.290 --> 00:22:16.330
What?

00:22:16.920 --> 00:22:18.750
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:23.130
In exchange, I'll shut up about "that".

00:22:24.090 --> 00:22:25.840
As expected, the best way to get to know each other…

00:22:25.840 --> 00:22:29.300
is through some naked bonding!

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:32.890
I don't want to get along with you!

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.600
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.600
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.600 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.130
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.130
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.130 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.370
Stuck Together by a Mysterious Light

00:24:06.320 --> 00:24:08.070
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.070 --> 00:24:10.570
Stuck together by a Mysterious light.

00:24:10.570 --> 00:24:13.780
I thought I could transform by saying "I am God!"

00:24:13.780 --> 00:24:16.490
And then it would go Pika! And Goii!

00:24:16.490 --> 00:24:19.210
But now I'm stuck to Kazune-kun!
